 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.68,
   "text": "right down here in the bottom left by clicking on the show transcript button."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.1,
   "end": 9.54,
   "text": "There, we see the entire conversation. Now, the transcript is really helpful, but here's one of"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.54,
   "end": 14.94,
   "text": "my favorite features. If we go all the way up to the top, we have what's called enhanced notes."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.76,
   "end": 21.48,
   "text": "granola uses AI to review the entire conversation and transcript, and it also transformed my notes"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.48,
   "end": 26.86,
   "text": "into a polished meeting summary. Right here, we can see that we finalized on 12 chocolate chips"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.86,
   "end": 32.06,
   "text": "in the cookies, we decided on adding sea salt, and right down here, we landed on September"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.06,
   "end": 33.98,
   "text": "15th as our launch date."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.46,
   "end": 36.52,
   "text": "I've got to say, this has been one productive meeting."
  },
  {
   "start": 36.98,
   "end": 38.76,
   "text": "Three decisions in under 30 minutes?"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.18,
   "end": 40.88,
   "text": "That's got to be some type of company record."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.16,
   "end": 45.98,
   "text": "You'll also notice that some of the text here is black, and some of the text is gray."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.72,
   "end": 52.12,
   "text": "The black text is what I wrote before the meeting, and here, the gray text is everything"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.12,
   "end": 54.1,
   "text": "granola generated from the conversation."
  },
  {
   "start": 54.62,
   "end": 57.46,
   "text": "Instead of replacing my notes, it builds on them."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.8,
   "end": 60.34,
   "text": "Granola also labels who said what throughout the meeting."
  },
  {
   "start": 60.66,
   "end": 64.7,
   "text": "Right here under responsibilities, I can see what Elizabeth signed up for, and here"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.7,
   "end": 66.4,
   "text": "I can see what I signed up for."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.14,
   "end": 71.72,
   "text": "If I want more context about something, here I could simply hover over and on the right"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.72,
   "end": 75.58,
   "text": "hand side, I'll click on the magnifying glass, and here I could see a transcript"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.58,
   "end": 78.04,
   "text": "summary of the relevant part of the conversation."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.96,
   "end": 83.66,
   "text": "If I want to make any edits to these notes, here I could click in and type in my changes."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.66,
   "end": 83.84,
   "text": "is."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.34,
   "end": 84.96,
   "text": "Now, once I'm..."
  }
